<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan forex turnover up at $8.63 bln-NBS.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan forex turnover up at $8.63 bln-NBS.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total foreign exchange trading in Slovakia rebounded to $8.63 billion in January, from $7.31 billion in December, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX TRADING    JANUARY     DECEMBER     NOVEMBER</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>  overall		     8,631	 7,307	   8,574</p>
<p>  USD trading		 4,919	 4,243	   4,984</p>
<p>  DM trading		  3,267	 2,627	   3,099</p>
<p>  other currencies	    445	   437	     490</p>
<p>TRADING IN USD</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix	     234	   193	     108</p>
<p>at Slovak banks	     3,574	 2,961	   3,783</p>
<p>  at foreign banks	  1,111	 1,089	   1,093</p>
<p>  total			 4,919	 4,243	   4,984</p>
<p>TRADING IN DM</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix	     136	    95	     150</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   2,470	 1,924	   2,163</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 661	   608	     786</p>
<p>  total			 3,267	 2,627	   3,099</p>
<p>TRADING IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     364	   317	     321</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  81	   120	     169</p>
<p>  total			   445	   437	     490</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF USD TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		35	    23		15</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,317	 1,023	   1,252</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 367	   309	     269</p>
<p>  total			 1,719	 1,355	   1,536</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF DM TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		40	    21		24</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,375	 1,094	   1,150</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 345	   295	     344</p>
<p>  total			 1,760	 1,410	   1,518</p>
<p>TOTAL  NUMBER OF TADES IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     265	   243	     251</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  70	    69		89</p>
<p>  total			   335	   312	     340</p>
<p>Note: All dollar figures are rounded off. All columns measure to end of period.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-521-8402</p>
